    \ points derived from the program and profiling:\n  - Stable id mapping relies\
    \ on uniqueness of (Series_Title, Released_Year).\n  - Runtime must parse as \"\
    <int> min\".\n  - Ratings must be numeric and bounded (IMDB_Rating in [0,10]).\n\
    \  - Votes must be non-negative integers.\n  - Released_Year should be a 4-digit\
    \ year within a plausible range.\n  - Poster_Link must look like a URL (http/https).\n\
    \  - Optional columns should validate only when present (use 'where' to ignore\
